            "block_content": "The Committee shall identify logical career ladders and determine a) the substance, kind, and priority of training and/or retraining programs, b) the location (i.e. on-site, regional, statewide) of such programs, and c) the criteria for s election of applicants, including the weight to be given to seniority.",
